# Allowlist build context: the Dockerfile only needs the Go module and its
# sources (including go:embed assets under internal/). Everything else --
# .env files, terraform/ state and kubeconfigs, runtime/ and secrets/, .git,
# .claude/, docs, and manifests -- stays out of the context and image layers.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!cmd/
!internal/

# Never ship local secrets even if one lands inside a source directory.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.tfstate*
**/kubeconfig*
**/coverage.out
